  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "A Central Continent rank eight Gu Immortal looks young, with deep and wise eyes, already some thousands of years old. He is named Chen Yi. Completing the assigned task would let him resign from his position and enter Heavenly Court. He is slightly moved, bows again, and thanks her as Lady Zi Wei.",
      "chapters": [
        1508
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_central_continent",
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "char_fairy_zi_wei"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He is dressed in a green robe and gives off a scholar’s aura. He looks young, with deep and wise eyes.",
      "chapters": [
        1508
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "He sits on a small mound at the palace, his legs crossed, aura almost entirely concealed, seeming fused with heaven and earth. He is a Heavenly Court rank eight Gu Immortal. Green smoke rises from his shoulders and head, gathers six feet above, and forms a tree with a thick trunk, lush leaves, and dozens of oddly shaped fruits. He stops the move, certain he has understood the flow of events around the palace and Qing Chou. He calls the move karma divine tree and treats it as still at rank eight. In his perception, Suan Bu Jin is an unlucky party implicated in the matter, and he conceals himself to wait for a chance to strike.",
      "chapters": [
        1516
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "ambush-preparation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_green",
        "char_qing_chou"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan charges with myriad fusion ghost dragon sword. Chen Yi looks at the sky, feels the approach as unstoppable, and as a spent force chooses not to block or evade. Bai Cang Shui and other Gu Immortals shout to rescue him, but Chi Qu You, Yi Hao Fang, and others follow Fang Yuan and block those reinforcements. An enormous soul sword pierces Chen Yi’s body and strikes Hairy Foot Mountain with its remaining force. The mountain disintegrates. Chen Yi’s corpse falls powerlessly. Southern Border and Northern Plains immortals are shaken that he is also dead.",
      "chapters": [
        1741
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "death",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
